Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:07.66,Chinese,C06-04-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}途中，月变化由正变负、出现移动锁定、剩余路线改变，都需要重读当前状态。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:07.66,English,C06-04-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}En route, a monthly supply change turning negative, movement locking,\Nor the remaining route changing all call for a fresh reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.26,0:00:11.33,Chinese,C06-04-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}库存没变，也不自动说明没有更新：
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.26,0:00:11.33,English,C06-04-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}Unchanged stock does not automatically mean there was no update.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:17.93,Chinese,C06-04-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}可能还没轮到、条件未通过、当前贡献为零，或增加后碰到容量。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:17.93,English,C06-04-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}The army may not have reached its turn, failed a condition,\Nhad zero contribution, or gained supplies only to reach capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:23.16,Chinese,C06-04-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}前后的日期和库存一起看，才能逐步分开这些解释。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:23.16,English,C06-04-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}Compare the dates and stocks to distinguish those possibilities.
